            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623930/extras/892bb1312e43043af6f537e6dac6b2ce.avif?t=1793102972\" width=572 height=113 /></span><br><br>Solaria Moon is a space adventure in 3D in which we will be on board of the enormous cargo spacecraft Taranis. Our protagonist, a young computer engineer named Lucy Lambert, wakes up completely disorientated in her hibernation capsule without a hint of what has happened. From that moment, it will take place a new adventure full of challenging puzzles to solve and mysteries to uncover. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623930/extras/f880d0f60daa3f20f16f6414b46f1acf.avif?t=1793102972\" width=572 height=105 /></span><br><br><strong>Main features</strong><br><br>•\tSpace adventure in 3D.<br>•\tHigh quality graphics. <br>•\tIntriguing and enigmatic plot.<br>•\tDozens of puzzles integrated in the development of the story.<br>•\tMultitude of interactive elements.<br>•\tExploration of the spacecraft Taranis.<br>•\tDistinguished original soundtrack.<br>•\tAccurate Spanish and English dubbing.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623930/extras/dbbc73fb841068b557e7405cae009116.avif?t=1793102972\" width=572 height=217 /></span><br><br><strong>Find out the truth </strong><br><br>An unexpected breakdown of the Tarani’s control systems have triggered a critical situation in the hibernation capsules. Only one crew member, Lucy Lambert, has survived the system overload. Immediately, she discovers that the capsule of her teammate, Nikolai Pavlov, is completely empty. From this moment on, Lucy will have to apply her instinct and ingenuity in order to find out what is happening on the enormous cargo spaceship Taranis and locate her teammate Pavlov.<br><br><strong>Explore Taranis spaceship</strong><br><br>To progress in this adventure, Lucy will have to go through all the hidden corners of the Taranis spaceship. The infirmary, the cabins, the reactor room or the bridge will only be a few scenarios in which Lucy will go into in order to uncover the truth about the Taranis and its crew. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/623930/extras/826808b8fb117ab6308f9126a4350553.avif?t=1793102972\" width=572 height=104 /></span><br><br>Visit our webpage: <strong></strong>",
