                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A nice and restful game without violence or almost. Music is good and graphics are clean and fine. The gameplay is alright and we feel the passion of the author to achieve things. But two hours and a half is a bit short as we want to continue to discover this beautiful and colorful environment well arranged and elaborated. Almost the feeling of being in the ship of Stargate Universe. A real potential that only needs other missions in and out the spacecraft while remaining realistic and perhaps less puzzles but things like more investigations and quests.",
